n nothing includes Knuth [1] and Lamport [2].", "text": "A tiny paper needs a tiny introduction. The method of Section 2 is one line, and Figure 1 shows it doing nothing in particular. Earlier work on nothing includes Knuth [1] and Lamport [2]."}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/6", "parent": {"$ref": "#/body"}, "children": [], "content_layer": "body", "label": "section_header", "prov": [{"page_no": 1, "bbox": {"l": 72.0, "t": 378.3832672, "r": 136.78881536, "b": 367.88942674812677, "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"}, "charspan": [0, 9]}], "orig": "1.1 Scope", "text": "1.1 Scope", "level": 1}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/7", "parent": {"$ref": "#/body"}, "children": [], "content_layer": "body", "label": "text", "prov": [{"page_no": 1, "bbox": {"l": 72.0, "t": 358.5974558, "r": 300.6466513000002, "b": 314.0248898772334, "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"}, "charspan": [0, 180]}], "orig": "Nothing at all is in scope, which is the point. The two columns of this page are there to see whether a converter reads the left column to the bottom before it starts on the right.", "text": "Nothing at all is in scope, which is the point. The two columns of this page are there to see whether a converter reads the left column to the bottom before it starts on the right."}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/8", "parent": {"$ref": "#/body"}, "children": [], "content_layer": "body", "label": "section_header", "prov": [{"page_no": 1, "bbox": {"l": 72.0, "t": 293.29049319999996, "r": 151.60562918000002, "b": 280.69791976829964, "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"}, "charspan": [0, 8]}], "orig": "2 Method", "text": "2 Method", "level": 1}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/9", "parent": {"$ref": "#/body"}, "children": [], "content_layer": "body", "label": "text", "prov": [{"page_no": 1, "bbox": {"l": 72.0, "t": 268.43245579999996, "r": 243.38959658000007, "b": 259.7258898772334, "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"}, "charspan": [0, 36]}], "orig": "The method is one numbered equation,", "text": "The method is one numbered equation,"}, {"self_ref": "#/te